T*
(differ by chart type, session type, target intent, or version.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Data Separation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calibration data and runtime profiles should be stored separately.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Domain | Purpose | Recommended handling) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Calibration runs | Generated from market data processing and analysis. | Keep in existing) Tj
T*
(calibration-oriented tables and export flow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Runtime profiles | Curated settings used by studies at runtime. | Store in separate) Tj
T*
(profile tables and publish as independent JSON artifacts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
